libmsiecf is a library to access the Microsoft Internet Explorer (MSIE) Cache File (index.dat) file format.

Project information:

* Status: alpha
* Licence: LGPL-3.0-or-later

Planned:

* Multi-threading support

For more information see:

* Project documentation: https://github.com/libyal/libmsiecf/wiki/Home
* How to build from source: https://github.com/libyal/libmsiecf/wiki/Building

